title: "Solar Sail Race 谁谓河广"
abstract: >-
  A non-real-time racing game about solar sails. The player steers a sail
  between gravity and light pressure to reach target orbits, and every run is
  scored by deterministic re-simulation of its replay.
type: software
version: "0.2.0"
